<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>twenty something</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Luke Chiang</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TYPHOON</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">10pa4Scz1Q7ctkUYGqniQs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.767" end="00:13.070">When I was younger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.070" end="00:17.095">I used to draw upon your walls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.095" end="00:23.502">Shapes and colors plastered on the halls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.502" end="00:25.002" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.772" end="00:26.556">When I got tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.556" end="00:30.756">You used to carry me to bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.756" end="00:36.531">Now I wake up and wish I could go back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.531" end="00:38.289" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.289" end="00:41.976">Time’s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.976" end="00:49.198">Messing with my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.198" end="00:55.771">Wish I never left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.771" end="01:01.857">But growing up is like that in the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.857" end="01:05.812">Ohh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.812" end="01:12.834">I’m learning how to live away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.834" end="01:18.915">Cause you used to be twenty something too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.915" end="01:26.915" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.067" end="01:35.424">My superheroes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.424" end="01:40.683">Whatever challenges you faced</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.683" end="01:45.102">Raising me, protecting me from pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.102" end="01:46.602" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.030" end="01:49.603">And now that I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.603" end="01:55.183">I see the sacrifice, the toll, the price you paid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.183" end="01:58.926">I’ll try to do the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.926" end="02:00.594" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.594" end="02:04.099">Time’s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.099" end="02:10.470">Messing with my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.470" end="02:18.068">Wish I never left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.068" end="02:24.270">But growing up is like that in the end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.270" end="02:26.258">Ohh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.258" end="02:28.230" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.230" end="02:34.724">When you’re gone I’ll try to make it through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.724" end="02:41.562">I’m learning how to live away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.562" end="02:45.562">Cause you used to be twenty something too</p></div></body></tt>